                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10032-208965-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <h3><a name="AC1%3ASendTenderThroughEmail"></a><ins>AC-1: Send Tender Through Email</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> a tender message is received with Communication Method = Email<br/>
<b>When</b> the Email Communication Service processes the request<br/>
<b>Then</b> an email shall be generated and sent to the configured recipient list.</p>

<h3><a name="AC2%3AIncludeTenderInformation"></a><ins>AC-2: Include Tender Information</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> an email is generated<br/>
<b>When</b> the carrier receives the email<br/>
<b>Then</b> the email shall contain sufficient shipment information to review the tender.</p>

<h3><a name="AC3%3AIncludeRecipientInformation"></a><ins>AC-3: Include Recipient Information</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> email recipient information exists<br/>
<b>When</b> the email is generated<br/>
<b>Then</b> the system shall populate:</p>

<ul>
	<li>To Address(es)</li>
	<li><del>CC Address(es), if configured</del></li>
	<li>From Address</li>
</ul>


<p>within the outbound email.</p>

<h3><a name="AC4%3AIncludeAcceptandDeclineActions"></a><ins>AC-4: Include Accept and Decline Actions</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> Communication Method = Email<br/>
<b>When</b> the email is generated<br/>
<b>Then</b> the email shall contain secure Accept and Decline links in form of buttons in the Review page where use can reach by clicking on Response link present in the email body'</p>

<h3><a name="AC5%3ATenderReviewLinkSelected%2FClicked"></a><ins>AC-5: Tender Review Link Selected/Clicked</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> a carrier selects/clicks tender review link from the email<br/>
<b>When</b> the link is opened<br/>
<b>Then</b> the carrier shall be redirected to a tender review page<br/>
<b>And</b> the tender shall not automatically be accepted or declined.</p>

<h3><a name="AC6%3AEmail%26EDICommunication"></a><ins>AC-6: Email &amp; EDI Communication</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> Communication Method = Email &amp; EDI<br/>
<b>When</b> the email is generated<br/>
<b>Then</b> the email shall be sent to the configured recipients<br/>
<b>And</b> Accept and Decline links in the form of buttons shall not be displayed in review page</p>

<h3><a name="AC7%3AEmailDeliveryFailure"></a><ins>AC-7: Email Delivery Failure</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> an email communication is initiated<br/>
<b>When</b> the mail server rejects or cannot accept the request<br/>
<b>Then</b> the tender status should be changed to Tender Failed<br/>
<b>And</b> shipment status should be changed to Use Review</p>

<h3><a name="AC8%3ASuccessfulEmailSubmission"></a><ins>AC-8: Successful Email Submission</ins></h3>

<p><b>Given</b> an email communication is initiated<br/>
<b>When</b> the mail server accepts the email request<br/>
<b>Then</b> the email communication shall be considered successfully sent.</p>
  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Sprint:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10021-208965-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">Skybreakers Sprint 44</td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>OdysseyONE Scrum Team:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_11762-208965-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">    Skybreakers
</td>
